      },
      "object 31": {
        "ID": 31,
        "gui": {
          "x": "640.0",
          "y": "340.0",
          "w": "300"
        },
        "parms": "2. change's other outlets. The counts below change say how often each fired. Click 1: it passes, and the left count goes up because the value left 0. Click 2: it passes, and neither count moves. Click 0: the right count goes up, back at 0. Click 0 again: nothing at all.",
        "type": ".text"
      },
      "object 32": {
        "ID": 32,
        "gui": {
          "x": "640.0",
          "y": "510.0",
          "w": "300"
        },
        "parms": "3. togedge bangs its left outlet when the value turns on, from 0 to anything else, and its right outlet when it turns off. The counts below it say how often each happened: 1 then 2 is still one switch-on. 0.5 counts as on.",
        "type": ".text"
      },
